        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p003",
        "quote": "南海哀王子師字孝友，孝武帝第二十二子也。",
        "note": "按當段敘事主語與爵位繫人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-younger-sons:p004:r0010",
        "surface": "南海王",
